---
description: SalkarsaUI design system rules for all UI code
globs: ["**/*.{tsx,jsx,ts,js,vue,svelte,css,scss,html,swift,kt}"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow @DESIGN.md and @AGENTS.md for every UI change.

- Only semantic tokens from tokens/tokens.css (var(--bg-default), var(--spacing-md), var(--radius-md), .text-body-md). No hex/px literals, no primitives.
- Reuse SalkarsaUI components and their props (DESIGN.md §4).
- Touch target ≥ 44px, visible focus, aria-label on icon-only buttons.
- Light/dark via data-theme; same token names.
